From 7290a0bc46473ae4cd8372e40205874c6778821f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ChonDoit <thphantomblog@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2020 05:41:39 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 31/31] Squashed: Expandable volume dialog

Squash of:
VolumeDialog: Display default row when active row is notification
VolumeDialogImpl: Don't vibrate when volume dialog is not visible
VolumeDialogImpl: Don't hide the default stream when adjusting the music stream
VolumeDialogImpl: Fix cut layout when on setup or lock task mode
VolumeDialogImpl: Drop unnecessary layout gravity defines and handle left
VolumeDialogImpl: Set touchable region properly for left gravity
VolumeDialogImpl: Respect left gravity in ringer drawer
VolumeDialogImpl: Handle the outmost row with respect to left gravity
SystemUI: Make the volume dialog expandable
VolumeDialogImpl: Add STREAM_NOTIFICATION row
VolumeDialogImpl: Ignore external layout direction changes
VolumePanel: Change bg tint for inactive rows
SystemUI: VolumeDialogImpl: Fix inactive rows tint
Volume Dialog: Recolor inactive icons/slider
Volume panel: avoid multiple animations on touch spam
VolumeDialogImpl: Handle cases where media controller is not available
---
